## Interface: 16001
## Title: WellMet
## Notes: One key buffs the next nearby player who needs it. Built for WoW Forever.
## Author: tek
## Version: 0.1.0
## DefaultState: enabled
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\WellMet\Icons\Icon
## SavedVariables: WellMetDB

# Data\Classes.lua loads first and decides whether this character's class can buff anyone (ns.supported);
# every other file returns at once if not, so WellMet does nothing on those characters.
# WoW Forever only. The client picks this file by its game-type suffix (_Camelot);
# there is deliberately no unsuffixed WellMet.toc. Bindings.xml loads automatically.

Data\Classes.lua
WellMet.lua
Core\DB.lua
Core\Spells.lua
Core\Discovery.lua
Core\Select.lua
Core\Cast.lua
Core\Macro.lua
Core\Probe.lua
Core\Debug.lua
UI\Options.lua
UI\Minimap.lua
